+    /* SPU_MB_ACK=<port>: a lifted thread whose run has ended (it faulted, or an
+     * image it needs could not be lifted) has nobody reading its mailbox. Answer
+     * each word with the completion event on that SPU port, so a PPU thread that
+     * writes a command and waits for the reply carries on. Opt-in stand-in: SEGA
